        "desc": {
          "en": "Designed with an open-source spirit from the ground up, we break down data silos, enable open knowledge sharing, and collectively advance the spatial omics community.",
          "zh-CN": "秉持开源精神打造，打破数据孤岛，促进知识共享，共同推动空间组学领域发展。"
